# SFT execution status v0.96

2026-09-16. The two-file synthetic thread-context fix is published and its new
GitHub Source and Spark checks both passed. This supersedes the CI-pending state
in v0.95; historical reports remain unchanged.

Commit: `9ae708c73a327b7cac69c16d29d075450a500e9d`.
Parent: `6585a1e073a6a5302630ed63a3c1a3d81adda429`.
Branch: `codex/lumi-posttraining-product-v0.1`.

## Verified result

- [Source checks](https://github.com/saidi19/lumi-model/actions/runs/35090272645):
  **success**, first attempt. All four jobs passed: frozen-lint-integrity,
  isolated-sft-controls, source-only-validators and test. The BF16 history check
  and the full selected Source suite also report success.
- [Spark source checks](https://github.com/saidi19/lumi-model/actions/runs/35090272657):
  **success**, including the synthetic-spark job.
- Local CI-pinned Ruff 0.15.1 passed on both files before publication. The 46
  affected/regression tests passed with and without an owned background thread;
  63 scope/workflow guard tests passed again before commit.
- The remote branch tip was rechecked after CI and matches the published commit.

Only `tests/test_sft_checkpoint_generator_entry_v1.py` and
`tests/test_sft_checkpoint_import_runner_v2.py` were committed: 84 insertions,
no deletions. Unrelated local diagnostics and evidence were not published.
Production runtime guards, workflows and private-integration routing were not
changed. There were no workflow reruns or manual dispatches, and no raw CI logs
were read during publication/verification.

## Remaining work

The Source CI failure addressed by these test-context fixes is now remotely
verified as repaired. This is not full private-integration or native-importer
qualification. The earlier native qualification failure remains open and its
attempt remains consumed. Its historical plan/test hashes were not silently
updated or reused; a new native successor must bind the changed tests explicitly.

Gate 5 is therefore still incomplete. No native qualification workflow, GPU
instance, real checkpoint import or real SFT training was started by this push.

Evidence: `evidence/lumi-4b-sft-source-thread-context-ci-result-v0.1.json` and
`evidence/lumi-4b-sft-source-thread-context-publication-v0.1.json`.
